            "repere": "Paragraphe · I absolutely love this sticky bra! Has…",
            "text": "I absolutely love this sticky bra! Has to be by far the best I have tried. not only is it sticky and sweat proof but the fabric and hold feels so natural and lightweight. Sometimes I wear it even when I don't need to! It gives such a good coverage and the cleavage ahh! I love so much. Just make sure you don't have any lotion on prior to applying.",
