            "repere": "Paragraphe · I tried and compared a bunch of the st…",
            "text": "I tried and compared a bunch of the sticky bras on the market for my wedding and gatherall was the winner hands down! The fit was great and didn't show at all, was comfortable and lasted ALL day & night. Customer service was excellent-- after my looong wear 1 area of the sticky was coming apart and they immediately sent me a replacement.",
